{"slug":"02-technik","language":"deu","text":"Frauen und Technik ist immer so bisschen schwierig. Ich wusste damals, ich werde kein Mensch für'n Büro und ich hab einfach immer gesagt, ich will technisch unterwegs sein, will selber was herstellen. (Hintergrundmusik) Also was mir am meisten Spaß macht, die neuen Techniken, weil wir neue Maschinen haben, da halt sich reinzufuchsen, ist auch echt cool. Wir haben einen sehr, sehr modernen Maschinenpark mit vielen abwechslungsreichen Technologien. Sollte eigentlich für jeden was dabei sein. Also wir haben eine große Technologievielfalt durch unser PCM, unser Rodieren. Dann haben wir noch unser HSC Fräsen. Metall drei D Druck wird immer größer und dann halt ganz normal schleifen, drehen, fräsen. Hier in der WTN durchläuft man alle Punkte. Ausbildung ist bei WTN kein Zuschauen. Hier fasst du Technik an, die es woanders kaum gibt.","words":[{"w":"Frauen","s":0.08,"e":0.58},{"w":"und","s":0.64,"e":0.78},{"w":"Technik","s":0.88,"e":1.4},{"w":"ist","s":1.44,"e":1.58},{"w":"immer","s":1.66,"e":1.82},{"w":"so","s":1.98,"e":2.26},{"w":"bisschen","s":2.9,"e":3.22},{"w":"schwierig.","s":3.32,"e":4.02},{"w":"Ich","s":4.32,"e":4.44},{"w":"wusste","s":4.48,"e":4.78},{"w":"damals,","s":4.84,"e":5.36},{"w":"ich","s":5.46,"e":5.58},{"w":"werde","s":5.64,"e":5.9},{"w":"kein","s":5.96,"e":6.12},{"w":"Mensch","s":6.2,"e":6.44},{"w":"für'n","s":6.5,"e":6.66},{"w":"Büro","s":6.7,"e":7},{"w":"und","s":7.24,"e":7.34},{"w":"ich","s":7.4,"e":7.52},{"w":"hab","s":7.58,"e":7.7},{"w":"einfach","s":7.76,"e":8},{"w":"immer","s":8.06,"e":8.22},{"w":"gesagt,","s":8.3,"e":8.62},{"w":"ich","s":8.72,"e":8.78},{"w":"will","s":8.82,"e":9.08},{"w":"technisch","s":9.14,"e":9.76},{"w":"unterwegs","s":9.82,"e":10.32},{"w":"sein,","s":10.38,"e":10.68},{"w":"will","s":11.22,"e":11.38},{"w":"selber","s":11.44,"e":11.72},{"w":"was","s":11.76,"e":11.92},{"w":"herstellen.","s":11.96,"e":12.64},{"w":"Also","s":20.06,"e":20.14},{"w":"was","s":20.2,"e":20.28},{"w":"mir","